==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 15~30 seconds<sup>450f~900f</sup>.
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore Jr.]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wicked Face]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
**2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Though the Wicked Face seems scary, the hardest part of the stage is actually the not-so-weak peons. Units with good damage outputs and/or AOE, such as Pizza Cat and Can Can Cat, are useful here. Wave-blockers and shield-piercers are almost required here. Any wave immune units are also very useful.

